      "content": "that makes sense. but i feel like some of those points are a bit vague for a formal memo. like, specifically with the 'crushing rivals' thing—is there actually a consensus on how much these companies are hurting innovation? or is it more of a political talking point? i want to make sure i'm not just repeating slogans if i'm gonna present this to my boss.",
